1
00:00:02,602 --> 00:00:04,502
（梅西百貨感恩節遊行）

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,170
Hey, hon? Would you help me get the plates down?
親愛的，你可以幫我把盤子拿下來嗎？

3
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:10,460
Hey, here's an idea. Why don't we use our wedding china today?
嘿，我有個主意 我們今天用我們的結婚瓷盤好不好？

4
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:14,570
Or we could save them for a fancy special occasion.
或者我們可以等到很特別的場合再用

5
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:18,070
How about this: You could treat me like I'm an equal..
可不可以這樣： 你要不就平等對待我…

6
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:21,940
or talk down to me like I'm a child.
要不就把我當成小孩對我說話

7
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:26,420
No, I just think we should save our china for something really special.
不，我只是認為我們應該把瓷盤留到 真正特別的場合使用

8
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,920
Like if the queen of England comes over.
像是英國女皇來訪的時候

9
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:32,480
Honey, she keeps canceling on us. Take the hint.
親愛的，她一直取消跟我們的約 你還不懂那是什麼意思嗎？

10
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,650
What if something breaks? They're expensive.
打破了怎麼辦呢？它們可是很貴的

11
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:38,890
What is the point of having them if we never use them?
東西擺著不用的意義何在呢？

12
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:42,040
Okay. But if something breaks and then the queen comes over..
好吧，但是如果打破了 然後女王又要來訪…

13
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:45,870
- I will explain it to her. - Like I'd let you talk to the queen.
-我會跟她解釋 -你以為我會讓你跟她說話啊

14
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:50,800
Wow, the parade is really good this year.
哇，今年的遊行真是棒

15
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,780
Man, those horses can crap.
天啊，那些馬還真能拉屎

16
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,940
Next up is a marching band from Muskogee, Oklahoma.
下一個遊行隊伍是來自 奧克拉荷馬州的馬斯科吉

17
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:00,250
Muskogee? That's like four hours from Tulsa!
馬斯科吉？離土爾沙才四小時車程！

18
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:03,690
Y'all look great!
你全看起來棒透了！

19
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:05,650
That's right, I said "y'all!"
沒錯，我是說「你全」

20
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:10,000
Here's the float with the stars of the popular daytime soap..
接下來是日間肥皂劇…

21
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:12,360
Days of Our Lives.
《我們的日子》的眾星們

22
00:01:15,570 --> 00:01:17,730
Oh, my God!
喔，我的天！

23
00:01:17,910 --> 00:01:21,770
Aren't you one of the stars of the popular daytime soap Days of our Lives?
你不是日間肥皂劇 《我們的日子》眾星之一嗎？

24
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:24,950
I forgot! I'm supposed to be there!
我忘了！我應該要參加遊行的！

25
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:29,980
I can't believe I forgot! I usually write stuff like this down on my arm!
我不敢相信我忘了！ 我通常會寫在手臂上的！

26
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:35,520
Stupid long sleeves!
爛長袖衣服！

27
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:39,790
- What are you gonna do? - I'll come up with a good reason..
-你要怎麼辦呢？ -我得找個好借口說明…

28
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:41,520
why I wasn't there.
我為什麼沒有到

29
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:44,490
The producers are gonna be mad. They sat us down and said:
製作人一定會很生氣 他們昨天把我們全都叫進去然後說：

30
00:01:44,670 --> 00:01:49,690
"Everyone has to be there,6 a.m. sharp. That means you, Tribbiani."
「大家都要在早上六點整到 尤其是你，崔比亞尼」

31
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:52,700
Like I was some kind of idiot.
好像我是什麼笨蛋似的

32
00:01:54,610 --> 00:01:56,770
Well, you proved them wrong.
嗯，你剛好證明了他們是錯的

33
00:01:58,218 --> 00:02:00,413
The One With Rachels Other Sister

00:02:01,218 --> 00:02:02,413
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

34
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,190
Oh, Emma.
喔，艾□

35
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:50,390
This is your first Thanksgiving.
這是你第一個感恩節

36
00:02:50,570 --> 00:02:52,930
What are you thankful for?
你要感謝什麼呢？

37
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:55,160
Mommy's boobies?
媽咪的胸部嗎？

38
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:58,630
A lot of people are thankful for those.
很多人都會感謝那東西的

39
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:02,980
Hello? Rachel?
哈囉？瑞秋？

40
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:04,300
Who is it?
是誰？

41
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:07,540
It's your favorite sister.
是你最喜歡的妹妹

42
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:10,080
- Jill? - Amy!
-吉兒？ -艾美！

43
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,180
Hide my rings.
把我的戒指藏起來

44
00:03:17,090 --> 00:03:20,320
Amy! Happy Thanksgiving.
艾美！感恩節快樂

45
00:03:25,170 --> 00:03:27,190
Do you have a hair straightener?
你有沒有直髮器呢？

46
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,460
Hi.
嗨

47
00:03:30,770 --> 00:03:32,070
- Hi. - Hi.
-嗨 -嗨

48
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,610
Hair straightener.
直髮器

49
00:03:34,780 --> 00:03:39,180
- I haven't seen you in, like, a year. - I know. I know. I've just been crazed.
-我好像一年沒有見到你了 -我知道，我知道，我忙翻了

50
00:03:39,380 --> 00:03:42,580
Well, me too. I had a baby.
喔，我也是，我生了小孩

51
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:46,190
I decorated Dad's office.
我把爸的辦公室重新裝潢了一次

52
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:51,790
Yeah? Well, unless you pushed a desk out of your vagina, not the same thing.
是嗎？除非你有把桌子從陰道擠出去 否則那可是不同的事

53
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:55,450
About that hair straightener, honey, I really need one.
關於直髮器的事 親愛的，我真的需要

54
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:58,430
I'm gonna have dinner at my boyfriend's house.
我要到我男朋友家用晚餐

55
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:01,530
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天

56
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:04,070
Is this Emmett?
這是愛門嗎？

57
00:04:07,740 --> 00:04:09,940
It's Emma.
是艾□

58
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:11,580
It's a girl?
是個女生？

59
00:04:13,510 --> 00:04:16,110
- Hey, Amy. - Amy, you remember Ross?
-嗨，艾美 -艾美，你記得羅斯吧？

60
00:04:17,290 --> 00:04:19,150
Not really.
不太記得

61
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:23,050
But you are much cuter than that geeky guy she used to date.
但是你比她之前的呆頭鵝男友可愛多了

62
00:04:25,930 --> 00:04:27,900
That was me.
那個人就是我

63
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:32,420
No, he was this creepy guy from high school who had this huge crush on her..
不，他是高中時代的怪男生 從好像是九年級…

64
00:04:32,630 --> 00:04:34,470
since, like, the ninth grade.
就很喜歡她的

65
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:36,070
Still me.
那還是我

66
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:38,570
No, I'm not talking about you.
不，我不是在說你

67
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:41,570
It was your fat friend's brother with that bad Afro.
那是你那個胖朋友的哥哥 留著可笑的黑人頭

68
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:45,770
Okay, Amy, I'm gonna save you some time, okay? All me!
好了，艾美，讓我節省你的時間 都是我！

69
00:04:50,790 --> 00:04:53,980
Careful. Careful.
小心，小心

70
00:04:54,290 --> 00:04:56,150
Careful!
小心！

71
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,860
I'll tell you what. For the rest of our lives..
這樣子好了 我們這一輩子…

72
00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:01,460
I'll be careful until told otherwise.
我都會很小心，除非你要我做別的

73
00:05:03,630 --> 00:05:06,100
- This isn't the china we picked out. - I know.
-這不是我們選的瓷盤 -我知道

74
00:05:06,300 --> 00:05:09,670
After you left the store, I chose different ones.
在你離開店裡之後，我選了別的

75
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:14,300
- Why? - Your taste is a little feminine for me.
-為什麼？ -你的品味對我而言太女性化了

76
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:17,070
Suddenly flowers are feminine?
花朵什麼時候變成女性化的象徵了？

77
00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:21,110
Hey, everybody! Happy Thanksgiving!
嘿，大家好！感恩節快樂！

78
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:23,650
- Happy Thanksgiving. Phoebe! - What's going on, Joe?
-感恩節快樂，菲比 -怎麼了，喬伊？

79
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:26,050
Listen, I need a good lie.
聽著，我需要編個天衣無縫的謊

80
00:05:26,220 --> 00:05:27,620
Okay.
好的

81
00:05:27,890 --> 00:05:31,880
How about the whole "man walking on the moon" thing, you know?
「人類走在月球上」那個謊言如何？

82
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:35,960
You can see the strings, people!
根本就可以看到線，真是的！

83
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:40,000
No, no, no. I need a good lie to explain why I wasn't at a work thing today.
不，不，我需要一個謊言來解釋 為什麼我今天錯過了一件工作的事

84
00:05:40,470 --> 00:05:42,960
- Honey, you stink at lying. - I do not.
-親愛的，你根本不會說謊 -我會的

85
00:05:43,170 --> 00:05:46,500
Really? Let me ask you something. Yesterday at the coffeehouse..
真的？讓我問你 昨天發生在咖啡屋的事…

86
00:05:46,670 --> 00:05:50,340
I went to the bathroom. When I came back, my muffin was gone. Who took it?
我去上廁所，回來的時候我的鬆餅 就不見了，是誰拿走的？

87
00:05:51,810 --> 00:05:54,010
Somebody opened the door to the coffeehouse..
有人打開咖啡屋的大門…

88
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:58,140
and a raccoon ran in and went straight for your muffin. I said:
然後一隻浣熊就跑進來 直接拿走你的鬆餅，我說：

89
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:01,620
"Hey, don't eat that! That's Phoebe's!" And he said..
「嘿，不能吃！那是菲比的！」 然後他說…

90
00:06:03,860 --> 00:06:07,660
He said, "Joey, you stink at lying." What am I gonna do?
他說「喬伊，你根本不會說謊」 我該怎麼辦呢？

91
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:10,530
Don't worry. We'll come up with a lie. I'll help you.
別擔心，我們會想個謊的 我會幫你的

92
00:06:10,730 --> 00:06:14,690
- Great. That'd be great. Thank you. - Sure. What was the work thing?
-太好了，太棒了，謝謝你 -沒問題，你錯過了什麼工作的事？

93
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:19,260
- "Pick up Grandma at the airport." - Oh, man!
-「到機場接奶奶」 -喔，天啊！

94
00:06:22,540 --> 00:06:24,840
She's precious.
她真是我的心肝寶貝

95
00:06:25,350 --> 00:06:29,080
Do you ever worry that she's gonna get your real nose?
你會不會擔心 她會遺傳到你真正的鼻子？

96
00:06:29,250 --> 00:06:31,180
Amy..
艾美…

97
00:06:32,290 --> 00:06:34,690
Yes, I do. I really do.
是的，我會，我真的會

98
00:06:39,090 --> 00:06:40,690
Hello?
喂？

99
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:44,390
Yeah, hang on, one sec. Can I take this upstairs?
是，等一下 我可以到樓上講嗎？

100
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:46,800
Sure. We don't live there, but..
當然，我們不住在樓上，但是…

101
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:51,760
Seriously? It's just these rooms?
真的嗎？只有這幾間房間？

102
00:06:52,470 --> 00:06:56,310
- I thought you were a doctor. - Yeah. No, Ross has a Ph.D.
-我以為你是醫生 -不，羅斯有博士學位

103
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:05,420
God, she is unbelievable.
天啊，她真是不可思議

104
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:08,710
I know. I mean, a Ph.D. is just as good as an MD.
對啊，博士學位就跟醫學學位一樣好啊

105
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,650
Sure, Ross, yeah!
是喔，羅斯，對啊！

106
00:07:10,830 --> 00:07:15,260
If I have a heart attack at a restaurant, I want you there with your fossil brush.
如果我在餐廳時心臟病發 我會希望你跟你的化石刷子就在一旁

107
00:07:17,230 --> 00:07:19,290
- Stupid Thanksgiving. - What?
-愚蠢的感恩節 -怎麼了？

108
00:07:19,470 --> 00:07:22,630
- What? What happened? - My boyfriend canceled on me.
-怎麼了？發生什麼事？ -我男朋友跟我取消約會了

109
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,300
I mean, I finally find a real relationship.
我好不容易才找到一段真感情

110
00:07:25,470 --> 00:07:30,430
Someone that I can spend this day with, and then his wife comes back into town!
一個可以跟我共渡今天的人 然後他老婆竟然回來了！

111
00:07:30,610 --> 00:07:33,840
I swear, it's almost not even worth dating married guys.
我發誓 跟已婚男人約會真是不值得

112
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,080
Don't say that.
別這樣說

113
00:07:37,490 --> 00:07:39,950
God, I was so looking forward to this.
天啊，我本來很期待今天的

114
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:43,150
It was gonna be such a beautiful Thanksgiving.
本來會是很美好的感恩節的

115
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:45,760
We were gonna have sushi.
我們本來要吃壽司的

116
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:49,620
Amy, don't cry.
艾美，別哭

117
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:54,500
- Ross, can I talk to you in private? - Sure, you wanna go upstairs, or..?
-羅斯，我可以私下跟你談談嗎？ -當然，你想要去樓上或是…？

118
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:02,370
Look, I was thinking, if it's okay with Monica..
聽著，我想如果摩妮卡不介意的話…

119
00:08:02,540 --> 00:08:05,140
I would like to invite Amy to Thanksgiving.
我想要邀請艾美跟我們共度感恩節

120
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:11,390
I think that's a great idea. It'll be like the Pilgrims bringing the Indians syphilis.
我認為這是個好主意，就像清教徒 把梅毒帶來美國給印地安人一樣

121
00:08:12,750 --> 00:08:15,650
Look, I know she's a little tough to take.
聽著，我知道她有點難搞

122
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:20,160
But she has nowhere else to go, and she's my sister. She's Emma's aunt.
但是她沒有其他地方可以去了 而且她是我妹妹，是艾□的阿姨

123
00:08:20,330 --> 00:08:25,320
- And I would like them to bond. - I don't want them bonding too much.
-而我想要讓她們相處融洽 -我不想要她們相處太融洽

124
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:28,030
I don't want her telling Emma she needs a nose job.
我不要她告訴艾□說 她需要整形

125
00:08:28,270 --> 00:08:32,210
Ross, she may need one. We're just gonna have to make our peace with that!
羅斯，她很可能會需要的 我們也只能接受了！

126
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:40,840
Amy..
艾美…

127
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:43,420
Amy?
艾美？

128
00:08:44,950 --> 00:08:46,420
Amy!
艾美！

129
00:08:46,590 --> 00:08:48,020
I'm out in the hall.
我在外面

130
00:08:48,190 --> 00:08:52,960
Your baby had some sort of explosion of stink.
你們的嬰兒好像爆發出一股臭氣

131
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:57,430
The bonding's going great.
相處的可真融洽

132
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:04,270
- Hi! - Hey.
-嗨 -嘿

133
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:07,640
Hey, you guys. This is my sister, Amy.
嘿，大夥兒，這是我妹妹艾美

134
00:09:07,810 --> 00:09:11,900
This is Chandler, Joey, Phoebe, and you know Mon.
這是錢德、喬伊、菲比 還有你認識的摩妮卡

135
00:09:12,110 --> 00:09:13,600
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天

136
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:15,980
You're on Days of Our Lives!
你有演《我們的日子》

137
00:09:16,180 --> 00:09:17,550
Yeah.
是的

138
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:21,120
Wow! They must put a lot of makeup on you.
哇！他們一定是幫你化很濃的妝

139
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:25,620
Happy Thanksgiving.
感恩節快樂

140
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:28,490
- Hey. - Hi.
-嘿 -嗨

141
00:09:30,830 --> 00:09:33,890
So welcome. Is this the first time you're seeing Emma?
歡迎，這是你第一次見到艾□嗎？

142
00:09:34,100 --> 00:09:37,230
Yeah, I think so. It's nice to meet you, Emma.
是的，我想是的 很高興認識你，艾□

143
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:42,770
- Phoebe. - That's a funny noise.
-菲比 -那聲音真好玩

144
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:50,310
- Phoebe? I still need some help here. - Right. Okay.
-菲比？我還需要你幫我 -好的

145
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:54,920
So it's not just the lie you tell, but it's the way you tell it. For example..
不止是你說的謊言本身 你說的方式也很重要，例如…

146
00:09:55,090 --> 00:09:58,420
if you look at the ground when you talk, people know you're lying.
如果你說的時候看著地上 人們就知道你在說謊

147
00:09:59,260 --> 00:10:03,290
I don't know why this is so hard for me. Lying is basically just acting..
我不知道為什麼這對我如此困難 說謊基本上就跟演戲一樣

148
00:10:03,460 --> 00:10:06,870
- and I am a terrific actor. - You are a terrific actor.
-而我可是演技精湛的演員 -你是演技精湛的演員

149
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:10,770
I could talk to the producers for you. I'm a great liar.
我可以幫你跟製作人說 我可是說謊高手

150
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:12,840
Take Monica's dress. I said I loved it.
舉摩妮卡的衣服當例子，我說我很喜歡

151
00:10:13,010 --> 00:10:14,530
- I hate it. - Hey!
-事實上我討厭極了 -嘿！

152
00:10:14,710 --> 00:10:17,140
I'm also a great moron.
我同時也是白癡高手

153
00:10:20,350 --> 00:10:23,480
- Hey. Where's the baby? - We just put her down for a nap.
-嘿，嬰兒在哪裡呢？ -我們剛把她抱去睡了

154
00:10:23,650 --> 00:10:27,350
Listen, I was just thinking. You know what would be incredible?
聽著，我剛剛在想 你們知道什麼事會很棒嗎？

155
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:30,220
If you guys died!
就是如果你們死了！

156
00:10:31,530 --> 00:10:33,720
Thank you, Amy.
謝謝你，艾美

157
00:10:33,930 --> 00:10:36,760
No, no, then I would get the baby.
然後我就可以得到嬰兒

158
00:10:36,930 --> 00:10:41,270
It would be just like a movie. At first I wouldn't know what to do with her.
就像是電影情節一樣 剛開始我會全無頭緒

159
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:45,570
And then I would rise to the occasion. Then I'd get a makeover and get married.
然後時機來臨時 我會完全改變，然後結婚去

160
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:48,110
That's a great movie!
很棒的電影！

161
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:52,740
Now, listen, not that you guys could stop me or anything..
反正你們也不能阻止我…

162
00:10:52,950 --> 00:10:55,310
because you know, you'd be dead.
因為你們已經死了

163
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:57,780
But I was thinking about changing her name.
但是我想要幫她改名字

164
00:10:57,950 --> 00:11:00,350
I'm just not really a big fan of Emily.
我就是不大喜歡艾蜜莉

165
00:11:01,990 --> 00:11:03,620
Emma.
艾□

166
00:11:04,290 --> 00:11:06,280
Emma? Ross wants you.
艾□？羅斯在叫你

167
00:11:08,630 --> 00:11:10,690
Phoebe!
菲比！

168
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,990
Why does she keep making that noise?
她為什麼一直發出那種怪聲呢？

169
00:11:17,570 --> 00:11:19,870
Honey, I don't know how to tell you this..
親愛的，我不知道要如何告訴你

170
00:11:20,070 --> 00:11:24,370
but if something were to happen to Ross or myself..
但是如果我跟羅斯發生了什麼事

171
00:11:24,610 --> 00:11:27,840
- you wouldn't get the baby. - Well, who would?
-你不會得到嬰兒的 -那，誰會呢？

172
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:32,150
Well, we haven't officially asked them yet..
嗯，我們還沒有正式問過他們

173
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:34,310
but we would want Monica and Chandler.
但是我們會希望是摩妮卡跟錢德

174
00:11:34,490 --> 00:11:36,680
- Who? - You're in their apartment.
-誰？ -我們正在他們的公寓裡

175
00:11:38,930 --> 00:11:41,220
I can't believe you'd want us to raise Emma.
我不敢相信你們要我們撫養艾□

176
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,330
Oh, my God, I'm so moved.
喔，我的天，我真是太感動了

177
00:11:43,530 --> 00:11:46,190
I don't believe this. Hold on a second. You guys die..
我不敢相信，等一下 你們死了…

178
00:11:46,370 --> 00:11:48,860
and I don't get your baby?
然後嬰兒不是我的？

179
00:11:49,070 --> 00:11:52,400
Amy, see, we're a lot closer to Monica and Chandler.
艾美，我們跟摩妮卡跟錢德比較親近

180
00:11:52,570 --> 00:11:56,840
We see them every day. And truthfully, you don't seem connected to the baby.
我們每天都見面，而且老實說 你好像也不太親近嬰兒

181
00:11:57,040 --> 00:12:00,610
Connected? To what? She's a lump.
親近？親近什麼？ 她只是一堆肉

182
00:12:03,250 --> 00:12:06,080
You know, guys, I've gotta say this means so much to me.
我必須要跟你們說 這對我意義重大

183
00:12:06,290 --> 00:12:09,590
I mean, that you would trust me with your child.
我是說，你們肯相信我 托負你們的孩子給我

184
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:12,390
I mean, we all know that Monica and I have been..
大家都知道摩妮卡跟我一直試著…

185
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:14,890
trying to have a baby of our own.
想要生小孩

186
00:12:15,060 --> 00:12:20,260
You know, I've had my doubts about my skills as a father, but..
我也有懷疑過 自己當父親的能力，但是…

187
00:12:21,770 --> 00:12:23,860
That you two..
你們兩個…

188
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:27,500
- That you two.. - This guy?
-你們兩個… -這個人嗎？

189
00:12:28,780 --> 00:12:30,300
Seriously?
真的嗎？

190
00:12:35,750 --> 00:12:37,950
Okay, it's time for dinner.
好了，晚餐時間到了

191
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,820
Everyone, we're using our fancy china..
各位，我們將使用我們的精緻瓷盤…

192
00:12:40,990 --> 00:12:44,920
and it's very expensive, so please be careful.
它們是很貴的，所以請小心

193
00:12:51,770 --> 00:12:55,460
Okay, just to be clear, comedy with the plates will not be well-received.
好了，再說明一次 不要拿這些盤子開玩笑

194
00:13:03,110 --> 00:13:04,870
Hey!
嘿

195
00:13:05,050 --> 00:13:08,980
How come my plate's less fancy than everyone else's?
為什麼我的盤子不如別人的精緻？

196
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,680
Do you not trust me with a fancy plate?
你不信任我 不讓我用你的精緻餐盤嗎？

197
00:13:12,850 --> 00:13:15,980
No, honey. That's a special plate.
不，親愛的，那是特別的盤子

198
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:19,850
See, it's a game. Whoever gets that plate wins.
這是一個遊戲 拿到那盤子的人就是贏家

199
00:13:21,430 --> 00:13:24,190
I can't believe I won!
我不敢相信我贏了！

200
00:13:25,170 --> 00:13:28,470
You know, this is such a slap in the face. I mean, I'm your sister..
這真的很侮辱，我是你妹妹…

201
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:32,570
and you would give your baby to these strangers over me.
你卻可以把嬰兒給這些陌生人而不給我

202
00:13:32,810 --> 00:13:35,300
Monica is Ross' sister.
摩妮卡是羅斯的妹妹

203
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:39,640
No, Ross' sister was really fat.
不，羅斯的妹妹很胖的

204
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:42,580
That was me.
那就是我

205
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:47,750
No, she was this dorky girl in school who followed Rachel around like a puppy..
不，她是個蠢蠢的女生 在學校時就像小狗一樣跟著瑞秋

206
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:50,320
Amy, you've got to stop doing that!
艾美，我不許你再這樣了！

207
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:59,260
Okay, listen, I know you're having a bit of a family crisis..
好了，我知道你現在正在經歷家庭危機

208
00:13:59,470 --> 00:14:02,030
but you don't have to take it out on the plates.
但是你不需要把氣出在盤子身上

209
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:05,040
I mean, in fact, I think that everyone..
其實我認為每個人…

210
00:14:05,210 --> 00:14:09,110
should cut their food like this:
都應該這樣切食物

211
00:14:11,410 --> 00:14:14,350
Now, see? This way, you protect the plates..
現在，看到了嗎？ 這樣不只可以保護盤子…

212
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:16,580
and let's face it, you have fun.
而且還挺好玩的

213
00:14:18,350 --> 00:14:21,120
Okay, how about this? If you guys die..
好吧，要是這樣呢？ 如果你們死了…

214
00:14:21,290 --> 00:14:25,120
and the crazy plate lady dies..
而且瘋狂盤子女士也死了…

215
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:29,360
- then do I get the baby? - No, if crazy plate lady..
-那我可以得到嬰兒嗎？ -不，如果瘋狂盤子女士…

216
00:14:32,100 --> 00:14:35,930
If Monica dies, then I would get Emma. Right?
如果摩妮卡死了 那艾□就是我的了，對嗎？

217
00:14:39,410 --> 00:14:42,200
- Well, actually.. - Actually what?
-嗯，其實… -怎樣？

218
00:14:42,410 --> 00:14:45,780
It's just.. It's just that in that case..
只是… 如果是那樣的話…

219
00:14:45,950 --> 00:14:47,880
then Emma would go to my parents.
那艾□就會去跟我父母親住

220
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:50,510
- What? - Hurts, doesn't it?
-什麼？ -很傷你的心，對不對？

221
00:14:54,050 --> 00:14:55,990
Who has to die for me to get her?
我要等誰死了才能得到她？

222
00:15:00,860 --> 00:15:04,160
So if Monica's not around, I'm not good enough to raise Emma?
所以如果摩妮卡不在了 我就沒有資格撫養艾□了？

223
00:15:04,370 --> 00:15:06,770
No, that is not what we're saying.
不，我們不是這個意思

224
00:15:06,970 --> 00:15:08,700
Yeah, he's lying. He looked down.
他在說謊，他看了地上

225
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:13,370
Well, what's wrong with me? Am I incompetent?
那我有什麼不好的呢？我無能嗎？

226
00:15:13,570 --> 00:15:17,170
Because I managed to survive whatever it is that killed the three of you!
因為無論是什麼東西殺了你們三個 我都存活了下來！

227
00:15:19,910 --> 00:15:24,940
You're taking this the wrong way. We think you are going to be a wonderful parent.
你反應過度了 我們認為你會是很好的父親

228
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:28,780
It's just.. You're more the, you know, fun parent.
只是…你是比較風趣的父親

229
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:33,150
Yeah, and we wanna make sure Emma also has someone like Monica..
是的，我們想要確定艾□也有像 摩妮卡這樣的人照顧

230
00:15:33,330 --> 00:15:35,230
who's more of a disciplinarian.
比較有紀律的人

231
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:38,260
Someone who can be firm and strict.
比較堅定嚴格的人

232
00:15:38,430 --> 00:15:40,990
That's not how you see me, is it?
你們對我的感覺不是真的那樣吧？

233
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:44,630
No, you're all about the fun.
不，你真的很好玩

234
00:15:50,810 --> 00:15:54,470
I may not know a lot about babies, but do you really think I'm not capable?
我或許不是很瞭解嬰兒 但是你們真的認為我沒有能力嗎？

235
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:57,410
No. You both are equally capable.
不，你們兩個能力相當

236
00:15:57,580 --> 00:16:00,140
It's just you're strongest when you're together.
只不過你們在一起的時候是最強的

237
00:16:00,350 --> 00:16:04,220
Okay. So if we both had Emma, and I died..
好的，如果我們有艾□，然後我死了…

238
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:06,590
she'd have to give her up.
她也不能擁有她

239
00:16:07,230 --> 00:16:09,860
Sure. Monica would have to give her up.
當然，摩妮卡也必須把她讓出來

240
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:13,370
I lie better than that, right?
我說謊說的至少比他好，對吧？

241
00:16:14,770 --> 00:16:18,700
Let me just get this straight. So my two friends die, I get Emma.
讓我搞清楚，如果我的兩個朋友死了 我得到艾□

242
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:22,970
Then my wife dies. Then Emma, the one tiny ray of hope left in my life..
然後我老婆死了，那我生命中剩下的 唯一一小塊希望，艾□…

243
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:26,640
- gets taken away from me? - There's your movie.
-也會從我身邊被帶走？ -演的好精采哦

244
00:16:32,950 --> 00:16:35,650
Hey, there you are.
嘿，你在這裡

245
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:39,020
- You disappeared after dinner. - Did somebody miss me?
-你在晚餐之後就消失了 -有人想念我嗎？

246
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:42,160
Was there a child to raise poorly?
有嬰兒需要被無能的父親撫養長大嗎？

247
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:44,930
Ross and Rachel don't know what they're saying.
羅斯跟瑞秋根本什麼都不懂

248
00:16:45,130 --> 00:16:47,000
It's not like they're so responsible.
他們自己也不是多有責任感

249
00:16:47,170 --> 00:16:51,630
Emma is a product of a bottle of merlot and a five-year-old condom.
艾□只不過是一瓶紅酒 跟一個過期保險套的產品

250
00:16:53,470 --> 00:16:57,470
No, but they're right. I'm not a strong father figure, and I never will be.
不，他們是對的，我不是強悍的父親 我永遠都不會是

251
00:16:57,710 --> 00:17:00,340
No, you learn these things. You grow into it.
不，這些是要學習的 你會逐漸學會的

252
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:02,340
Yeah, but it's not who I am.
是的，但那就不是我了

253
00:17:02,550 --> 00:17:07,680
Everything they said is exactly why I was worried about having a kid. And it's true.
他們說的一切，都是我擔心有小孩之後 會面對的問題，是真的

254
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:10,820
- And look, everybody knows it. - I don't know it.
-而且，大家都知道 -我並不知道

255
00:17:10,990 --> 00:17:14,550
I wanna have a kid with you because I think you'll be an amazing dad.
我要跟你生小孩因為我認為 你會是很棒的父親

256
00:17:14,730 --> 00:17:17,360
At the fun parts and at the hard parts.
不管是風趣還是有紀律

257
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:21,060
Well, can you picture me saying, "Go to your room, you're grounded"?
那你可以想像我說 「回房去，你被禁足了」嗎？

258
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:24,270
Can you hear me say, "You're grounded"?
你可以想像我說「你被禁足了」嗎？

259
00:17:24,470 --> 00:17:26,910
You said that to me last week.
你上星期才那樣對我說

260
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:32,230
How hard is it? "No shoes on the furniture!"
我叫你不要穿著鞋子踏在傢俱上 到底有多難呢？

261
00:17:38,790 --> 00:17:42,920
The producer from Days left a message asking why I wasn't at the parade.
製作人剛剛留言 問我為什麼沒有參加遊行

262
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:47,290
They said everybody's really pissed off at me. And they all got to meet Santa!
他說大家都對我很不爽 而且他們都有見到聖誕老公公！

263
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,400
It's okay. I thought of the perfect lie for you.
沒關係，我幫你想了一個完美謊言

264
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:55,060
It's easy to remember, and it doesn't invite a lot of questions.
很容易記，而且不會引來更多的問題

265
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:58,230
Does it have something to do with a spaceship?
是跟太空船有關的嗎？

266
00:17:58,410 --> 00:18:00,810
The Statue of Liberty came to life..
自由女神活了過來…

267
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:07,200
You weren't at the parade because you had a family emergency.
你沒有參加遊行 因為家裡出了緊急狀況

268
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:09,750
I like that! Yeah!
我喜歡！耶！

269
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:12,780
I wasn't at the parade because I had a family emergency.
我沒有參加遊行 因為家裡出了緊急狀況

270
00:18:13,190 --> 00:18:15,160
What happened?
發生什麼事？

271
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:18,380
- My sister's raccoon came.. - No, nothing with a raccoon!
-我姐的浣熊… -不，別提浣熊！

272
00:18:21,530 --> 00:18:24,360
- Wait, what are you doing? - Setting the table.
-等等，你們在做什麼？ -擺餐具

273
00:18:24,530 --> 00:18:28,370
We thought it might be nice to use the fancy china for dessert too.
我們覺得用這些精緻餐盤來吃甜點 應該也很不錯

274
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:32,160
How nice. Maybe later we can all go blow our noses on my wedding dress.
很不錯，或許等一下我們可以 去拿我的結婚禮服來擤鼻涕

275
00:18:39,410 --> 00:18:41,750
Hey, dude, you okay? Sorry about before.
嘿，兄弟，你還好嗎？ 剛剛的事我很抱歉

276
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:46,150
That's okay. You're totally right. I don't know anything about disciplining a child.
沒關係，你完全是對的 我根本就不知道如何管教孩子

277
00:18:46,320 --> 00:18:50,850
But it did hurt my feelings, and I want you to know that if I die..
但是我還是很傷心 而且我要你知道，如果我死了…

278
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:53,250
you don't get Joey.
你別想得到喬伊

279
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:10,070
In case you hadn't noticed, I'm not talking to you.
如果你還沒注意到 我現在不會跟你說話的

280
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:14,940
You know, this is just.. This is classic Rachel.
真的是… 這是典型的瑞秋

281
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:19,640
Oh, yeah, right. Remember in high school when I died and didn't give you my baby?
喔，對喔，記得在高中我死的時候 也沒有把我的嬰兒給你嗎？

282
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:25,160
This might be my one chance to have a child, Rachel.
這或許是我唯一擁有小孩的機會，瑞秋

283
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:28,690
I mean, you know that I have been so busy focusing on my career..
你知道我一直忙於我的事業…

284
00:19:28,860 --> 00:19:32,660
- What career? - I'm a decorator.
-什麼事業？ -我是室內設計師

285
00:19:32,870 --> 00:19:36,230
You decorate Dad's office and now you're a decorator?
你裝潢了爸的辦公室 就是設計師了嗎？

286
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:41,070
Okay, I went to the zoo yesterday, now I'm a koala bear.
好的，我昨天去了動物園 現在我就是無尾熊了

287
00:19:43,910 --> 00:19:47,710
- Why can't you ever be supportive? - You wanna talk supportive?
-你為什麼不能多支持我一點？ -你要談支持嗎？

288
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:51,650
You didn't come and visit me when I was in the hospital having the baby!
我在醫院生小孩時你可沒有來看過我！

289
00:19:51,890 --> 00:19:55,880
You didn't come see me in the hospital when I was getting my lips done!
我在醫院整形嘴唇時你也沒有來看我！

290
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,520
I did the first time.
我第一次有去

291
00:20:01,730 --> 00:20:05,160
You know what? You wanna know why I am not giving Emily to you?
你想知道我為什麼不要 把艾蜜莉給你嗎？

292
00:20:05,330 --> 00:20:07,770
- Emma. - Whose side are you on?!
-是艾□ -你是站誰那邊的？

293
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:13,660
I'm not giving you Emma because you can't handle the responsibility of a child.
我不給你艾□，是因為你無法扛起 照顧小孩子的責任

294
00:20:14,170 --> 00:20:17,540
Well, how hard could it be? You do it.
那有多難呢？你都做得到

295
00:20:21,950 --> 00:20:25,210
You wanna know why you don't want me to have the baby?
你知道，你為什麼 不想讓我得到嬰兒嗎？

296
00:20:25,390 --> 00:20:27,650
Because you don't want me to be happy.
因為你不想看到我快樂

297
00:20:27,820 --> 00:20:31,450
- You have always been jealous of me. - Jealous of what?
-你總是在忌妒我 -忌妒你什麼？

298
00:20:31,630 --> 00:20:35,320
Of your lack of responsibility? Your immaturity?
忌妒你沒有責任感嗎？ 還是你的不成熟？

299
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:38,490
Your total disregard for other people's feelings?
你那種完全忽略別人感受的作為嗎？

300
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:41,030
To name a few.
這只是其中幾項

301
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:44,530
You've always been like this.
你總是這樣

302
00:20:44,710 --> 00:20:48,140
You had to have everything, and I couldn't have anything.
你總是要所有的東西 而我什麼都得不到

303
00:20:48,310 --> 00:20:51,510
Like in junior high, when you stole Timmy from me.
就像在國中的時候 你搶走我的提米

304
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:54,550
I mean, do you even realize how much that hurt me?
你知道那傷我有多深嗎？

305
00:20:54,780 --> 00:20:57,220
Timmy was my boyfriend, and you made out with him!
提米是我的男朋友 而你跟他偷親熱！

306
00:20:57,420 --> 00:21:00,510
Come on, that was 20 years ago. Get over it.
別這樣，那已經是二十年前的事了 別太記恨

307
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:03,760
I cannot believe that I invited you here today!
我不敢相信我在今天邀請了你

308
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:07,860
Yeah, well, you know what I cannot believe? That my so-called sister..
是喔，你知道我不能相信什麼嗎？ 我所謂的姐姐…

309
00:21:08,030 --> 00:21:12,860
gets a 30 percent discount from Ralph Lauren, and I still have to pay retail?
有洛夫羅倫七折的折扣優惠 而我卻要付零售價

310
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:16,790
It's 45.
是五五折

311
00:21:18,170 --> 00:21:20,000
You bitch.
你這個賤人

312
00:21:22,540 --> 00:21:24,510
You just think you're so perfect..
你就是認為你很完美…

313
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:28,380
with your new baby and your small apartment.
擁有你的新生兒 還有你的小公寓

314
00:21:29,850 --> 00:21:35,020
Well, let me tell you something. Your baby isn't even that cute.
讓我告訴你一件事 你的嬰兒並不怎麼可愛

315
00:21:36,390 --> 00:21:40,090
Too far, Amy. Too far.
太過分了，艾美，太過分了

316
00:21:42,330 --> 00:21:44,350
- You take that back. - No.
-你收回那句話 -不

317
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:47,000
- Take it back! - No. What are you gonna do? Make me?
-收回那句話！ -不，你能怎樣呢？強迫我嗎？

318
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:50,100
Hey, man, I work out!
嘿，我有上健身房！

319
00:21:51,710 --> 00:21:53,610
- So do I. - I do Pilates.
-我也有 -我有做普拉提

320
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:55,540
- I do yoga. - Bring it on!
-我有做瑜伽 -放馬過來！

321
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:58,940
Put the plates in the boxes! Put the plates in the boxes!
盤子放到箱子裡！ 盤子放到箱子裡！

322
00:22:01,420 --> 00:22:03,850
- Did you just push me? - Yeah, I think I did.
-你剛剛推了我嗎？ -是的，沒錯

323
00:22:04,050 --> 00:22:05,350
All right, that's it.
好了，夠了

324
00:22:05,550 --> 00:22:08,350
Forget the bubble wrap! There isn't time!
別管泡泡包裝了！沒有時間了！

325
00:22:10,590 --> 00:22:12,390
Frizzy, frizzy, frizzy!
卷，卷，卷！

326
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:19,860
- Shouldn't we stop this? - Are you out of your mind?
-我們應該阻止她們嗎？ -你瘋了嗎？

327
00:22:20,030 --> 00:22:22,400
Let's throw some Jell-O on them!
我們應該倒一些果凍到她們身上！

328
00:22:24,940 --> 00:22:26,370
Hey, someone could get hurt.
嘿，有人會受傷的

329
00:22:26,540 --> 00:22:29,100
Kick her, Rach! Kick her!
踢她，瑞秋！踢她！

330
00:22:29,280 --> 00:22:32,180
Pull her top off, Rach! Pull her top off!
把她上衣脫掉，瑞秋！ 把她上衣脫掉

331
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:38,750
Gross!
噁心！

332
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:55,360
All right, that is it! This is our apartment, and you cannot behave this way!
好了，到此為止，這是我們家 你們不可以有這種行為！

333
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:58,300
If you can't act your age, you shouldn't be here at all.
如果你們不能表現得像成人 你們就不應該在這裡

334
00:22:58,510 --> 00:23:03,410
Those plates may not be as nice as the pretty pink ones that I picked out..
那些瓷盤或許沒有像我挑的那些 粉紅色瓷盤好看…

335
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:09,340
but they're important to Monica. And I want you to apologize to her, now.
但是它們對摩妮卡很重要 而我要你們現在就跟她道歉

336
00:23:09,620 --> 00:23:12,140
- I'm sorry. - Mon, I'm so sorry.
-我很抱歉 -摩妮卡，我很抱歉

337
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:14,220
Okay. That's better.
好了，這樣好多了

338
00:23:14,420 --> 00:23:17,750
Now, I want you to apologize to each other and mean it.
現在，我要你們誠心地跟彼此道歉

339
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:19,790
- Sorry. - Sorry.
-對不起 -對不起

340
00:23:19,990 --> 00:23:23,330
By the way, that fight was totally arousing.
對了，剛才那場架真是讓人情慾高漲

341
00:23:27,530 --> 00:23:29,470
Dude, well done.
幹的好

342
00:23:29,670 --> 00:23:34,700
If I die and Rachel dies and Monica dies, you can totally take care of Emma.
如果我跟瑞秋還有摩妮卡死了 你可以照顧艾□

343
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:37,210
Yeah? Well, thanks.
是嗎？謝謝

344
00:23:37,710 --> 00:23:40,840
So.. So now do I get Joey?
那… 那我可以得到喬伊嗎？

345
00:23:42,720 --> 00:23:47,550
Okay. But you should know he eats a lot and shoves pennies up his nose.
好的，但是你得知道他一天吃五餐 而且還會塞硬幣到鼻孔裡

346
00:23:52,690 --> 00:23:54,850
Are you okay, Mon?
你還好嗎，摩妮卡？

347
00:23:55,030 --> 00:23:58,730
I mean, these things happen. I mean, it's just a plate.
這種事常發生的 只不過是盤子而已

348
00:23:58,900 --> 00:24:02,670
- It's not like somebody died. - It's all right. You can mourn.
-又不像是有人死了 -沒關係的，你可以哀悼的

349
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:06,970
Thank you. It was so beautiful!
謝謝你 這些本來都很漂亮的！

350
00:24:09,110 --> 00:24:11,370
I'm gonna go to Joey's and get the pies.
我要去喬伊家拿幾個派

351
00:24:11,580 --> 00:24:15,340
Actually, not pies. It's just pie.
事實上，不是幾個派，是一個派

352
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:18,910
I don't care.
我不在乎

353
00:24:19,090 --> 00:24:22,680
Oh, my God, I've lost the will to scold.
天啊，我已經失去嘮叨的力氣了

354
00:24:26,730 --> 00:24:28,850
Look, Amy..
聽著，艾美…

355
00:24:29,300 --> 00:24:30,890
we got a little..
我們有一點…

356
00:24:31,060 --> 00:24:33,900
a little out-of-control over there.
失去了理智

357
00:24:34,600 --> 00:24:36,070
And I'm sorry.
我很抱歉

358
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:38,800
You're my sister..
你是我妹妹…

359
00:24:39,010 --> 00:24:41,410
and if it really means that much to you..
如果你真的很在乎…

360
00:24:41,740 --> 00:24:44,710
- So you're gonna give me the baby? - No, I was..
-那你要給我你的嬰兒了嗎？ -不，我只是…

361
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:47,940
I was gonna let you use my Ralph Lauren discount.
我只是要讓你用我的洛夫羅倫折扣

362
00:24:49,320 --> 00:24:52,250
You are not gonna regret this.
你不會後悔的

363
00:24:55,120 --> 00:24:58,320
- She needs changing. - No, no, no. I'll get her.
-她要換尿布了 -不，不，不，讓我去

364
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:03,050
I am super confident, totally responsible and fourth in line to raise Emma.
我超級有自信，完全有責任感 而且是扶養艾□第四順位的人

365
00:25:03,230 --> 00:25:07,600
I'll be right there, Emma! Just let me get my trusty diaper bag here.
我馬上就來，艾□！ 先讓我拿一下我的尿片袋子

366
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:16,230
Well, what do you know? I guess I'll be the one who dies first.
人算不如天算 我想我將是第一個死的人

367
00:25:26,190 --> 00:25:29,850
- Does Monica know about her plates? - Nope.
-摩妮卡知道瓷盤的事嗎？ -不知道

368
00:25:30,090 --> 00:25:31,580
- Broke them all, huh? - Yep.
-全都打破了，是嗎？ -是的

369
00:25:31,790 --> 00:25:33,620
- You gonna tell her? - Nope.
-你要告訴她嗎？ -不想

370
00:25:35,700 --> 00:25:39,290
Hey. So I'm gonna put the plates back.
嘿，我要把這些盤子放回去

371
00:25:39,470 --> 00:25:42,830
I think you're right. We shouldn't use these plates for a long time.
我想你是對的，我們近期內不應該 再用這些盤子

372
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:46,500
- Like only if the queen comes? - Maybe not even then.
-只有女皇來的時候才用嗎？ -或許那也不是時候

373
00:25:47,610 --> 00:25:49,130
Hey. I did it.
嘿，我辦到了

374
00:25:49,340 --> 00:25:52,830
I told my producer I had a family emergency. He totally bought it.
我告訴我的製作人說 我家裡發生緊急事件，他完全相信我

375
00:25:53,010 --> 00:25:57,680
- Thanks for teaching me how to lie. - No problem. Next week, stealing.
-謝謝你教我如何說謊 -不用客氣，下星期教你偷竊竊

376
00:25:59,050 --> 00:26:02,020
- Bye, plates. - You told her you broke all the plates?
-再見，盤子 -你告訴她你打破所有的盤子了？

377
00:26:04,360 --> 00:26:07,190
What?! Something happened with the plates?
什麼？ 盤子發生什麼事了嗎？

378
00:26:08,830 --> 00:26:11,820
Yeah, this raccoon came in..
是啊，一隻浣熊跑進來…

379
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


380
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
